// Ch12 B12 "Forty-seven voices" (E, 3 min). act2_ch12.md §2 B12; RULE 4: the confession is Ysolde's own,
// unprompted, the same night. The Quellan inn at night by the fire; Asha awake on a bench; Ysolde comes down
// the stair, hair half down (the Level-pin is still in it: she drops it in Ch14). ADR 0204 §12: the scene
// reprises `ysolde_theme`. She doesn't do the maths on Corran here (that is the Archive's, Ch13). Q05: Toma
// on the stair has heard; he sits on the hearth step with his back to them, a guard's place.
title: ch12_forty_seven_voices
location: ch12/quellan
---
@letterbox on
@camera Q03
@music silence fade=2.0
@mark ysolde inn_hearth walk
@wait 3.0
@camera Q04
@music ysolde_theme fade=3.0
Ysolde [guilty]: I read the cords. I lied to you about them. I would like to stop doing that now. #line:ch12_voices_001
@wait 2.0
Asha [neutral]: What do they say? #line:ch12_voices_002
Ysolde [neutral]: They are a count. Hers. Ama Quillo's, the Saint at the dais, before she was Hesk. Every Cantor on the roll up to her own name, one knot each. Forty-seven. #line:ch12_voices_003 #long
@wait 1.5
Ysolde [neutral]: And then the Saints. The houses that keep one. One knot each. #line:ch12_voices_004
@wait 1.5
Ysolde [cold]: Forty-seven voices. Seven houses. #line:ch12_voices_005
@wait 2.5
Asha [afraid]: ...Where did the rest go? #line:ch12_voices_006
Ysolde [sad]: She tied that too. A question-knot. Hanging at the end of the count, by itself. #line:ch12_voices_007
@wait 1.5
Ysolde [sad]: She sang anyway. She believed faith could hold a question. #line:ch12_voices_008
Asha [sad]: Could it? #line:ch12_voices_009
Ysolde [grief]: I have visited my husband every year for eleven years, Lady Cantor. I would very much like it to. #line:ch12_voices_010
<<set $ch12_ysolde_confessed = true>>
@camera Q05
@mark toma hearth_step walk
@anim toma sit_back_turned
@wait 3.0
Toma [neutral]: Seven houses. #line:ch12_voices_011
@wait 3.0
Toma [grief]: I stood guard at four of them. #line:ch12_voices_012
@camera Q06
@wait 4.0
@music silence fade=4.0
@letterbox off
===
